**Be honest in your README**
- Aegis runs in user mode, so it detects and quarantines files shortly after they appear. It can't block a program at the exact moment of launch like Defender does with kernel drivers.
- Heuristics can produce false positives, which is why results are labeled SUSPICIOUS or MALICIOUS and only MALICIOUS files are auto-quarantined.
